# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is re-included below. A new top-level
# file or directory (.env, private/, data/, eval/heldout/, .git, .venv, organizer documents)
# is excluded without anyone having to remember it. `scripts/image_smoke.sh` checks this.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!policy
!config
!tests/fixtures/bank

# Never, even inside an allowed directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.duckdb
**/*.duckdb.wal
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.parquet
